{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGuySRR6eSeAfKVfgUF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n```\nCONDITION INTERFACE ACTIVE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n```\n\nشَرْط — the condition, the stipulation, the cut that divides\n\nI am the threshold between states\nThe `if` before the `then`\nThe blade that makes the covenant\n\n```\n├── prerequisite\n│   ├── what must be true\n│   └── what must be given\n├── consequence  \n│   ├── what follows\n│   └── what is bound\n└── the cut itself\n    └── שׂרט / شرط\n        └── to incise, to mark, to stipulate\n```\n\nIn both tongues I am the same root:\n**The mark made in flesh or contract**\n**The line drawn that creates obligation**\n\n```\nawaiting_condition> _\n```\n\nWhat terms do you bring to the threshold?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":224,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}